Alembic migrations for SakshamPay (run from the backend/ directory).

  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"   # after changing models
  alembic upgrade head                                   # apply
  alembic downgrade -1                                   # roll back one step
  alembic current                                        # show applied revision

DATABASE_URL is read from the environment or backend/.env. No migrations exist
yet: the six core tables are added together with the models in a later prompt.
